        <item>
            <title>Version 1.6.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 22 Jul 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>38</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>MeetingRecorder 1.6.0 — Redesign</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Completely redesigned popover: calmer list, actions on hover, quick status at a glance</li>
                    <li>Built-in transcript reader with a synced audio player — click any line to jump, adjust speed, follow the highlighted phrase</li>
                    <li>Play now opens the reader with playback, right where the words are</li>
                    <li>Gentle corner notifications for call start/end — no more focus-stealing dialogs</li>
                    <li>When the mic or screen permission is missing, the app now offers to record with what's available and a one-click Grant</li>
                    <li>Clear monthly-quota banner with the reset date</li>
                    <li>Refreshed onboarding and Settings, full dark-mode support</li>
                    <li>Rename or trash a recording together with its transcript and summary from the right-click menu</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/emishin/meetingrecorder-updates/releases/download/v1.6.0/MeetingRecorder-1.6.0.dmg"
