            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>MeetingRecorder 1.5.5</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Recording indicator: a blinking red dot now appears on the menu-bar icon while recording (orange while paused), and the icon is a bit larger</li>
                    <li>Stop is now instant on long recordings — the button no longer hangs while the file is saved</li>
                    <li>More reliable error reporting: filtered out false "app freeze" noise so real issues stand out</li>
                    <li>Better diagnostics when a transcription fails, to help us fix failures faster</li>
